      <title>艾博生物CEO英博确认：人类首个mRNA肿瘤疫苗完成三期突破</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/ai001/post/20260830/%E8%89%BE%E5%8D%9A%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9CEO%E8%8B%B1%E5%8D%9A%E7%A1%AE%E8%AE%A4%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E9%A6%96%E4%B8%AAmRNA%E8%82%BF%E7%98%A4%E7%96%AB%E8%8B%97%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E4%B8%89%E6%9C%9F%E7%AA%81%E7%A0%B4/</link>
